	abstract = {We analyze restarted PDHG on totally unimodular linear programs. In particular, we show that restarted PDHG finds an ϵ-optimal solution in O(Hm12.5nnz(A)log⁡(Hm2/ϵ)) matrix-vector multiplies where m1 is the number of constraints, m2 the number of variables, nnz(A) is the number of nonzeros in the constraint matrix, H is the largest absolute coefficient in the right hand side or objective vector, and ϵ is the distance to optimality of the outputted solution.},
