llation, hence doesn't make it economically viable to construct.},
	journal = {2013 Fourth International Conference on Computing, Communications and Networking Technologies (ICCCNT)},
	author = {Pereira, Viren and Kunkolienkar, G. R.},
	year = {2013},
	keywords = {EMI shielding},
}

