	keywords = {Optical films, Gold, Spectrophotometry, Metallic thin films, Applied Mathematics [921], and scanners (A4280E), Applied Physics Generally [931], Au films, Buildings and Towers [402], choppers, deflectors, diaphragms, Drude theory, Effective medium theories, EFFECTIVE MEDIUM THEORIES, Electromagnetic wave transmission, Energy efficient windows, Film structure, FILMS - Optical Properties, Frequency dependence, GOLD AND ALLOYS, INFRARED RADIATION - Reflection, INFRARED REFLECTORS, ION PLATING, Light, Metal network, Minor, Near infrared transmittance plateaus, Optical properties of metals and metallic alloys (thin films/low-dimensional structures) (A7865E), Optical shutters, Optics and Optical Devices [741], Precious and Rare Earth Metals and Alloys [547], REFLECTIVITY, Relaxation energy, RELAXATION PROCESSES, SOLAR RADIATION - Spectrum Analysis, Solar transmission, Space Physics [657], VACUUM EVAPORATION, windows, WINDOWS - Coatings},
