	note = {Backup Publisher: NASA, Ames Res Ctr, Ctr Nanotechnol, Moffett Field, CA 94035 USA; NASA, Ames Res Ctr, Ctr Nanotechnol, Moffett Field, CA 94035 USA; Univ Cambridge, Dept Engn, Cambridge CB2 1PZ, England},
