	keywords = {Mercury, Silicon, Nanostructured materials, Charge transport, Transport properties, Boron, Fermi level, Cadmium, Cobalt, FIELD-EFFECT TRANSISTORS, Niobium, Others (including Bismuth, Selenium, Tellurium and Zirconium) [549.3], Liquids and Solid [931.2], Physical Properties of Gases, Crystalline Solids [933.1], Atomic and Molecular Physics [931.3], Semiconductor quantum dots, CARBON NANOTUBES, Quantum Theory [931.4], Current voltage characteristics, Mechanics [931.1], Coulomb blockade oscillations, ELECTRON QUANTUM DOTS, Oscillations, Quantum electronics, Quantum levels, Silicon nanowires (SiNW), SPIN},
