	issn = {0935-9648},
	abstract = {Si nanowires were grown laterally in microtrenches that were prefabricated on silicon-on-insulator (SOI) wafers, demonstrating that nanowire growth and device fabrication can be achieved simultaneously. Excellent epitaxial growth of bridging Si nanowires and effective control of diameters, lengths and densities was demonstrated. Electrical measurements showed that the nanowires in trenches could serve as versatile active components in circuits. It was found that the control capabilities make the nanowire-in-trench strategy desirable for various applications, such as chemical sensors, FETs and nanomechanical resonators. (40 Refs.)},
