	keywords = {Finite element method, Silicon, silicon, Viscosity, Atomic force microscopy, Nanostructured materials, Oxidation, Transistors, Substrates, simulation, Si, Silicon on insulator technology, silicon-on-insulator, Surface treatment (semiconductor technology) (B2550E), Crystalline Solids [933.1], Elemental semiconductors, Semiconductor Devices and Integrated Circuits [714.2], Chemical Reactions [802.2], Semiconducting Materials [712.1], Mechanical Properties [421], Strength of Building Materials, Energy gap, THERMAL-OXIDATION, Computer simulation, Semiconductor device modelling and equivalent circuits (B2560B), Semiconductor device models, Internal stresses, Bandgap, Bioengineering [461], Dilational strain, Electron potential profile, Oxidation induced strain, Oxidation induced stress, oxidation-induced strain and stress, Oxidation-induced strain and stress, Oxide viscosity, Pattern dependent oxidation, pattern-dependent oxidation, Pattern-dependent oxidation, Quantum interference devices (B2560X), Self diffusion, Silicon nanostructures, Silicon on insulator, Silicon on insulator substrates, Silicon oxidation, Single electron transistor, Single electron transistors, single-electron transistors, Single-electron transistors, Stress analysis, Stress dependency, Stress induced reduction, Transition layer, Two dimensional simulation, Viscoelastic solids, Volume expansion},
