	keywords = {Oscillations, CAVITY, Jaynes Cummings model, Laser nanomechanical analog, Magnetic force microscopy, Magnetic moments, Magnetic moments and susceptibility in magnetically ordered materials (A7530C), Magnetic resonance force microscopy, MAGNETIC-RESONANCE, Magneto-optical effects (condensed matter) (A7820L), Magnetomechanical and magnetoelectric effects, Magnetomechanical effects, Magnetostatic dipole dipole interaction, magnetostriction (A7580), Mechanical oscillations, MICROSCOPE, MOTION, Nanocantilever, Permanent magnet, Permanent magnets, Permanent magnets (B3120E), QUANTUM, Quantum optics (A4250), Quantum oscillator, RADIATION, Stimulated Zeeman transitions, Strong external magnetic field, Zeeman effect},
