	keywords = {CMOS, PERFORMANCE, Si, Electron mobility, MOSFET, SiO2, CMOS integrated circuits, Silicon on insulator technology, O, O2, Osub 2, CHANNEL, Insulated gate field effect transistors (B2560R), Semiconducting silicon, Semiconductor Devices and Integrated Circuits [714.2], Single Element Semiconducting Materials [712.1.1], DEFORMATION, Hole mobility, SILICON, MOBILITY, MOSFET devices, LAYERS, Strain, Internal stresses, SUBSTRATE, Silicon on insulator, Silicon on insulator substrates, Effective mobility, Elastic uniaxial strain, Hole mobility enhancement, Mechanically induced strain enhancement, Metal oxide semiconductor field effect transistors, NMOSFETs, PMOSFETs, Saturation current, Semiconductor device measurement, SI MOSFETS, Si SiOsub 2, Si-SiO2, Strain enhancement, Strained silicon partially depleted MOSFETs, Straining, Uniaxial tensile strain},
