	issn = {0921-5107},
	abstract = {We flattened the rough surface of the strain-relaxed Sisub 0.7Gesub 0. buffer layers by chemical mechanical polishing technique and successfully obtained the ultra-smooth surface whose root mean square roughness was less than 1 nm. The regrowth of Sisub 0.7Gesub 0.3 films on the polished Sisub 0.7Gesub 0.3 buffer layer was found to keep its surface roughness less than 1 nm, and efficient photoluminescence with narrow line width was observed from quantum wells grown on the polished buffer layer. This indicates high crystalline quality of the regrown layer with smooth interfaces, which makes it possible to fabricate high-performance SiGe devices with low surface roughness scattering. CP 2002 Elsevier Science B.V. All rights reserved. (12 Refs.)},
