	keywords = {RESONATORS, DISSIPATION, ELECTRON, AMPLIFIER-NOISE, Displacement measurement, Spatial variables measurement (B7320C), 1.5 MHz, Crystal resonators, DETECTOR, Displacement sensitivity, Electrostatic forces, Electrostatic top gates, FIELD-EFFECT TRANSISTOR, Frequency 1.5E+06 Hz, Magnetomotive forces, Mechanical resonance frequency, MIXERS, Nanomechanical displacement sensing, Nanometer scale resonators, Piezoelectric devices (B2860A), Quantum limited displacement sensing, Quantum point contact, Quantum point contacts, Radio frequency mechanical resonator, Radio frequency mixer, REGIME, Spatial variables measurement (A0630C)},
