	note = {Backup Publisher: Belarusian State Univ Informat \& Radioelect, P Browka 6, Minsk 220027, Byelarus; Belarusian State Univ Informat \& Radioelect, Minsk 220027, Byelarus; Univ Modena \& Reggio Emilia, Ist Nazl Fis Mat, I-41100 Modena, Italy; Univ Modena \& Reggio Emilia, Dipartimento Fis, I-41100 Modena, Italy; Ctr Rech Mecanismes Croissance Cristalline, F-13288 Marseille 9, France},
	keywords = {Silicon, Optical absorption, Optical properties, Oxidation, Si, Oxygen, O, Elemental semiconductors, Photoluminescence, Light absorption, POROUS SILICON, ABSORPTION, Atomic- and molecular-orbital methods (condensed matter electronic structure) (A7115F), Oxygen content, Quantum confinement, H, EMISSION, LUMINESCENCE, Photoluminescence in elemental semiconductors (A7855C), GAPS, Optical properties of elemental semiconductors (thin films/low-dimensional structures) (A7865H), Spectral line shift, Hydrogen, SI NANOCRYSTALS, Cluster approximation, Cluster configurations, Emission energy, Equilibrium ground state position, H38, H40, Hsub 38, Hsub 40, Light emission, Localized character, Modified neglect of diatomic overlap parametric method 3, NDO calculations, Optical properties of pure homogeneous materials: general theory (A7820B), Optical transition energies, OPTIMIZATION, Other methods of electronic structure calculations (condensed matter) (A7115T), PARAMETERS, PM3 calculations, SCF calculations, Self consistent field (SCF) calculations (condensed matter electronic structure) (A7115J), Self consistent semiempirical molecular orbital method, SEMIEMPIRICAL METHODS, Si:H, SI/CAF2 NANOSTRUCTURES, Si30, Si30H38O, Si30H40O, Silanone bond, Sisub 30, Sisub 30Hsub 38O, Sisub 30Hsub 38O cluster, Sisub 30Hsub 40O, Small silicon pyramidal clusters, Stokes shift},
