ISBN: 0964002426},
	keywords = {Design, Reactive ion etching, Substrates, Ion implantation, Sputter etching, Other Electronic Circuits [713.5], Semiconductor Devices and Integrated Circuits [714.2], Semiconducting Materials [712.1], Mechanical Instruments [943.1], Machining Operations [604.2], Microsensors, Microsensors (B7230M), Aspect ratio, Microelectromechanical devices, Micromachining, Spurious signal noise, Design and modelling of micromechanical devices (B2575D), Fabrication of micromechanical devices (B2575F), Mechanical variables measurement (B7320G), 1/f noise, 1/F NOISE, acceleration and rotation measurement (B7320E), Accelerometers, CANTILEVER, Construction, deep reactive ion etching, Deep reactive ion etching, Flexures, fusion wafer bonding, Fusion wafer bonding, High performance planar piezoresistive accelerometer, lateral implantation, Micromachined piezoresistive accelerometer, micromachines, Multiaxis accelerometers, oblique implantation, Oblique ion implantation, Piezoresistive accelerometer, piezoresistive accelerometers, Piezoresistive devices, Piezoresistive strain sensors, piezoresistors, Piezoresistors, Resistors (B2120), Self caging proof masses, Sidewall piezoresistive strain sensors, SILICON ACCELEROMETER, Strain sensors, Velocity, Vertical sidewalls},
