	keywords = {Scanning electron microscopy, Dielectric materials, Transmission electron microscopy, Silicon compounds, Si, SiO2, Surface composition, Interface states, Silicon dioxide, Liquids and Solid [931.2], O, O2, Osub 2, Physical Properties of Gases, Semiconductor Devices and Integrated Circuits [714.2], Chemistry [801], Dielectric thin films, Conduction bands, band structure, Dielectric Materials [708.1], Dielectric materials and properties (B2810), Scanning transmission electron microscopy, STATES, Electronic structure, Electronic structure of crystalline semiconductor compounds and insulators (A7125T), RESOLUTION, Interfaces (materials), Surface states, INTERFACE, Solid surface structure (A6820), electron density of states (A7320A), Si SiOsub 2, Si-SiO2, Solid-solid interfaces (A6848), 1.2 nm, Atomic scale, Chemical composition, Conduction-band wavefunctions, Dielectric layer, Dielectric thin films (A7755), Electrical properties of insulators (thin films/low-dimensional structures) (A7360H), Electron energy loss spectra, Electron energy loss spectroscopy, Field effect device structures, Gate oxides, Interface roughness, Interfacial states, Miniaturization trends, Other electron-surface impact phenomena (A7920K), Oxide growth techniques, Scanning transmission electron microscope, Semiconductor device structures, Silicon conduction band wavefunctions, Silicon dioxide gate dielectric, Silicon oxide interfaces, Size 1.2E-09 m, Thin dielectric layer, Ultrathin films, Ultrathin gate oxides},
