	note = {Backup Publisher: IBM CORP, DIV RES, THOMAS J WATSON RES CTR, POB 218, YORKTOWN HTS, NY 10598},
	keywords = {Silicon, Si, Semiconductor materials, Ge, Band structure, SiGe, Germanium, Elemental semiconductors, Carrier mobility, Low-field transport and mobility, piezoresistance (semiconductors/insulators) (A7220F), Hole mobility, Electronic structure of crystalline elemental semiconductors (A7125R), Pseudopotential methods, Elemental semiconductors (B2520C), Electronic structure of crystalline semiconductor compounds and insulators (A7125T), QUANTUM-WELLS, Ge Si alloys, Other semiconductor materials (B2520M), analytic continuation, applications of group theory, Alloy scattering, Compressive strain, CUBIC SEMICONDUCTORS, Deformation potentials, Dilatation deformation potential, Effective alloy scattering potential, Electrical conductivity of elemental semiconductors (A7280C), Electrical conductivity of other crystalline inorganic semiconductors (A7280J), etc.) (A7125C), HOLE DRIFT VELOCITY, Low field mobilities, Many valley semiconductors, MONTE-CARLO SIMULATION, Nonlocal empirical pseudopotentials, Optical deformation potential, Phonon limited carrier mobilities, RELAXED SI1-XGEX, Shear deformation potentials, SI/GE SUPERLATTICES, SI/SIGE HETEROSTRUCTURES, SI1-XGEX ALLOYS, Strained Ge, Strained Si, Strained SiGe alloys, Techniques of band-structure calculation (general theory, TEMPERATURE ELECTRON-MOBILITY, Tensile biaxial strain, Tensile strain, TRANSPORT PROPERTIES},
