	copyright = {(c)2007 The Thomson Corporation},
	issn = {0003-2700},
	abstract = {An electroless deposition procedure for filling the pores in nanoporous filtration membranes with metal (gold) nanowires is described. This method allows us to routinely prepare ensembles of gold nanodisk electrodes in which the nanodisks have diameters as small as 10 mm, Results of electrochemical experiments at ensembles of 30- and 10-nm-diameter gold disk electrodes are described, The electrochemical response characteristics of these nanoelectrode ensembles are in agreement with predictions of the relevant electrochemical theories. Cyclic voltammetric detection limits for electroactive species at ensembles containing 10-nm-diameter gold disks can be as much 3 orders of magnitude lower than those at large-diameter gold disk electrodes.},
