	keywords = {Si, Ge, GaAs, InP, InAs, InSb, In, Sn, Zn, Elemental semiconductors, Conduction bands, Electronic structure of crystalline elemental semiconductors (A7125R), Pseudopotential methods, GaP, P, As, Ga, Electronic structure of crystalline semiconductor compounds and insulators (A7125T), III V semiconductors, Band gaps, Li, analytic continuation, applications of group theory, etc.) (A7125C), Techniques of band-structure calculation (general theory, Alpha LiZnSb, Alpha Sn, Charge distributions, Conduction band edge, Electronic charge densities, Empirical pseudopotential method, GaSb, Group IV elemental semiconductors, Heteropolar semiconductors, III V compound semiconductors, Interstitial insertion rule, LiZnSb, Sb, Wave function symmetry dependence},
