	abstract = {After summarizing the essential features of an idealized model of the Si/SiOsub 2 interface, the authors discuss first-principles EMTO calculations of the electronic structure of SiOsub 2 supercells and Si/SiOsub 2 superlattices containing periodic arrays of noninteracting localized defects. Among the defects investigated were Si and O interstitials and vacancies, interstitial Osub 2, SiO, and Hsub 2O molecules; and substitutional Al-interstitial H complexes. As an application of these theoretical studies, they suggest an interpretation of the U-shaped continuum of localized interface states which is often derived from experimental measurements of suitably processed Si/SiOsub 2 interfaces.},
